e toolkit is up to date ({0})␟工具包已是最新版本（{0}）␞This toolkit version can't update on request; it looks for a newer version each time it starts␟此版本的工具包无法按请求更新；它会在每次启动时检查新版本␞Automatic oto␟自动 oto␞Entries are made from the file names (kana, romaji or Cyrillic syllables) and the recordings.␟根据文件名（假名、罗马音或西里尔字母音节）和录音生成条目。␞Which files␟哪些文件␞This file␟此文件␞Files without entries␟没有条目的文件␞Every file in the folder␟文件夹中的所有文件␞Recording style␟录音风格␞Detect␟检测␞Tempo of the recording, BPM (0 = find from the audio)␟录音速度，BPM（0 = 从音频中检测）␞Offset before the consonant, ms␟辅音前的偏移，ms␞Consonant part into the vowel, ms␟辅音进入元音的部分，ms␞Existing entries of these files␟这些文件的现有条目␞Keep, add missing aliases␟保留，添加缺少的别名␞Replace␟替换␞How to find syllables␟音节查找方式␞Built in (loudness and voicing) — recommended␟内置（响度和发声检测）— 推荐␞Aligner model from the toolkit (slower)␟工具包中的对齐模型（较慢）␞The built-in way is usually better and takes seconds. Aligner models learned on sung phrases, not on single syllables with silence around them: they place consonant starts less exactly, need the syllables turned into their own phonemes (which fails for some banks) and load a large model first.␟内置方式通常效果更好，且只需数秒。对齐模型是在演唱乐句而非前后带有静音的单个音节上训练的：它们对辅音起点的定位不够精确，需要先将音节转换为对应的音素（部分音源会失败），并且需要先加载大型模型。␞This file: {0}␟此文件：{0}␞Make entries␟生成条目␞{0} – {1} ({2})␟{0} – {1}（{2}）␞What to label␟标注内容␞Selected part␟所选部分␞Whole recording␟整个录音␞How␟方式␞Place a known text␟放置已知文本␞SOFA, HubertFA · the text is needed␟SOFA、HubertFA · 需要文本␞Recognise phonemes␟识别音素␞WFL · no text needed␟WFL · 无需文本␞The aligner places what is sung: words (turned into phonemes with the model's dictionary) or phonemes. It doesn't guess the text; without text it can only work after Whisper has recognised the words.␟对齐器放置所演唱的内容：词（使用模型词典转换为音素）或音素。它不会猜测文本；没有文本时，只能在 Whisper 识别出歌词后工作。␞The model hears the phonemes itself, no text needed. If you know the phonemes, enter them: then it only places them.␟模型自行识别音素，无需文本。如果已知音素，请输入：此时模型只负责放置它们。␞What is sung there␟该处演唱的内容␞e.g. twinkle twinkle little star␟例如 twinkle