model␟模型␞Rename in bulk␟批量重命名␞Pattern␟模式␞Replace a name␟替换名称␞Add to the end␟添加到末尾␞Add to the start␟添加到开头␞Find (regular expression)␟查找（正则表达式）␞Replace with (${'$'}1, ${'$'}2 … for groups)␟替换为（${'$'}1、${'$'}2 … 表示分组）␞Name (exactly, e.g. ax)␟名称（完全一致，例如 ax）␞New name␟新名称␞Text to add (e.g. G4)␟要添加的文本（例如 G4）␞Only names matching (regular expression, empty = all)␟仅匹配的名称（正则表达式，留空 = 全部）␞The whole folder␟整个文件夹␞Aliases of oto.ini.␟oto.ini 的别名。␞Labels of the tier "{0}".␟层“{0}”的标注。␞Files of the folder that aren't open are written at once (the previous version goes to .mlabeler/backup); the open file can be undone.␟文件夹中未打开的文件将立即写入（之前的版本保存到 .mlabeler/backup）；当前打开的文件可以撤销。␞{0} will change␟{0} 将被更改␞Pattern error: {0}␟模式错误：{0}␞Renamed: {0}␟已重命名：{0}␞Renamed: {0} in {1} files␟已重命名：{1} 个文件中的 {0}␞Clean the recording␟清理录音␞The file keeps its sample rate, bit depth and channels. Only what is repaired changes; every other sample stays exactly as it was. The first version is kept in the folder's .mlabeler/backup.␟文件保持原有的采样率、位深和声道。只有修复的部分会改变；其他所有采样点保持原样。第一个版本保存在文件夹的 .mlabeler/backup 中。␞Where␟范围␞Clicks␟爆音␞Finds short pops and clicks and rebuilds just those few samples from the sound around them.␟查找短促的爆音和咔嗒声，并仅根据周围的声音重建这几个采样点。␞Sensitivity␟灵敏度␞Longest click␟最长爆音␞Find␟查找␞Repair found ({0})␟修复已发现的爆音（{0}）␞Clear marks␟清除标记␞Repair the selected part␟修复所选部分␞Select a click by hand (up to 100 ms) and rebuild it from both sides.␟手动选择一处爆音（不超过 100 ms），并根据两侧重建。␞Repair␟修复␞Silence or cut out␟静音或剪切␞Silencing keeps the length (Ctrl+Shift+M in the editor); cutting out makes the recording shorter and moves the labels after it back (Ctrl+X). Both work on the selection or the selected phoneme and are undone with Ctrl+Z.␟静音保持长度不变（编辑器中按 Ctrl+Shift+M）；剪切会缩短录音并将其后的标注前移（Ctrl+X）。两者均作用于选区或所选音素，并可按 Ctrl+Z 撤销。␞Level and edges␟电平和边缘␞Normalising works on the chosen part (above) or the whole file; fades on the selection. Trimming cuts silence off both ends of the file and moves the labels with the sound. All are undone with Ctrl+Z.␟标准化作用于所选部分（上方）或整个文件；淡入淡出作用于选区。修剪会去除文件两端的静音，并随声音移动标注。均可按 Ctrl+Z 撤销。␞Loudest point after normalising␟标准化后的峰值␞Normalise␟标准化␞Fade in␟淡入␞Fade out␟淡出␞Silence is quieter than (from the loudest part)␟静音判定：低于（相对于最响部分）␞Silence kept at each end␟两端保留的静音␞Trim silence at the ends␟修剪两端的静音␞Silence the selection␟将选区静音␞Noise␟噪声␞Lowers steady noise (hum, hiss) where it's quieter than the voice. Unlike the tools above it changes the whole processed part: listen first.␟在比人声更安静的位置降低稳定噪声（嗡嗡声、嘶嘶声）。与上述工具不同，它会改变整个处理部分：请先试听。␞Take the noise from the selected part␟从所选部分获取噪声␞Noise taken from {0} – {1}␟已从 {0} – {1} 获取噪声␞Select a part with noise only (a pause) and take it first.␟请先选择仅含噪声的部分（停顿处）并获取噪声。␞Lower by␟降低量␞Frequency smoothing␟频率平滑␞Listen␟试听␞Apply␟应用␞Undo the last change␟撤销上次更改␞Restore the original␟恢复原始录音␞bands␟频段␞Play from cursor␟从光标处播放␞Nudge left ×10␟向左微调 ×10␞Nudge right ×10␟向右微调 ×10␞Previous boundary␟上一个边界␞Next boundary␟下一个边界␞Tier above␟上方的层␞Tier below␟下方的层␞Go to start␟转到开头␞Go to end␟转到结尾␞Left panels␟左侧面板␞Right panels␟右侧面板␞Formants over the spectrogram␟在频谱图上显示共振峰␞Normalise the level␟标准化电平␞Offset to cursor␟偏移移至光标␞Overlap to cursor␟重叠移至光标␞Preutterance to cursor␟先行发声移至光标␞Consonant to cursor␟辅音移至光标␞Cutoff to cursor␟截止移至光标␞Next entry␟下一个条目␞Previous entry␟上一个条目␞Delete entry␟删除条目␞Duplicate entry␟复制条目␞New entry at cursor␟在光标处新建条目␞Preutterance moves all markers␟先行发声移动所有标记␞Listen with the drawn pitch (quick)␟使用绘制的音高试听（快速）␞Listen with the drawn pitch (DiffSinger vocoder)␟使用绘制的音高试听（DiffSinger 声码器）␞The vocoder is NSF-HiFiGAN by OpenVPI (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0: non-commercial use only); it is downloaded on first use.␟声码器为 OpenVPI 的 NSF-HiFiGAN（CC BY-NC-SA 4.0：仅限非商业用途）；首次使用时下载。␞Cut into segments…␟切分为片段…␞Rename in bulk…␟批量重命名…␞Phoneme names on the picture␟在画面上显示音素名称␞Automatic oto…␟自动 oto…␞Quick plugin {n}␟快捷插件 {n}␞Note a semitone higher␟音符升高一个半音␞Note a semitone lower␟音符降低一个半音␞Note pitches from the recording␟从录音获取音符音高␞Group phonemes into notes␟将音素分组为音符␞Notes from groups and pitch␟根据分组和音高生成音符␞""",
    """Spread typed phonemes over the selection␟将输入的音素分布到选区␞Draw the pitch in the pitch lane␟在音高层中绘制音高␞Next place to check (worst first)␟下一个待检查处（最差优先）␞Previous place to check␟上一个待检查处␞Arrange panels and lanes␟排列面板和层␞Dataset summary…␟数据集概况…␞Check the recordings…␟检查录音…␞Export a DiffSinger dataset…␟导出 DiffSinger 数据集…␞Save notes as MIDI␟将音符保存为 MIDI␞Notes from a MIDI file next to the recording␟从录音旁的 MIDI 文件导入音符␞Help␟帮助␞Autolabel the selected part…␟自动标注所选部分…␞Cursor tool: click selects, drag moves␟光标工具：点击选择，拖动移动␞Cut tool: click adds a boundary␟剪切工具：点击添加边界␞Hand tool: dragging scrolls␟抓手工具：拖动滚动␞Play tool: a click plays the phoneme␟播放工具：点击播放音素␞Bigger label text␟增大标注文字␞Smaller label text␟减小标注文字␞Clean the recording…␟清理录音…␞Silence the selection in the recording␟在录音中将选区静音␞Select a part or a phoneme first␟请先选择一部分或一个音素␞Cut the selection out of the recording␟从录音中剪切选区␞Sound editing (labels locked)␟声音编辑（标注已锁定）␞Lock lane and panel sizes␟锁定层和面板大小␞Read the recording again␟重新读取录音␞Clear the selection␟清除选区␞Folder settings…␟文件夹设置…␞Dataset summary␟数据集概况␞Reading the labels: {0} of {1}…␟正在读取标注：{0}/{1}…␞Recordings␟录音␞{0} in the folder · {1} labelled · {2} done␟文件夹中 {0} 个 · 已标注 {1} 个 · 已完成 {2} 个␞{0} labelled · {1} without pauses␟已标注 {0} 个 · {1} 个没有停顿␞Phonemes␟音素␞{0} different, {1} in all␟{0} 种，共 {1} 个␞Rare phonemes␟少见音素␞A model learns a phoneme from its examples: with only a few, it is often sung wrong. Click one to find its files.␟模型从音素的样本中学习：样本很少时，该音素常常唱错。点击可查找其所在文件。␞at most␟最多␞None␟无␞Compared with the dictionary␟与词典比较␞Pick a dictionary to see phonemes it lacks and ones never used.␟选择词典以查看其缺少的音素和从未使用的音素。␞Not in the dictionary␟不在词典中␞Never used␟从未使用␞All phonemes are in the dictionary and all of it is used␟所有音素均在词典中，且词典已全部使用␞How much is sung on each note. Gaps in the range are notes the model hasn't heard.␟每个音符上的演唱量。音域中的空缺是模型未听过的音符。␞All phonemes␟所有音素␞Phoneme␟音素␞Times␟次数␞Total␟总计␞Average␟平均␞Playback␟播放␞Volume␟音量␞While playing, the view␟播放时，视图␞Stays in place␟保持不动␞Turns the page at the edge␟到达边缘时翻页␞Scrolls smoothly, the playhead stays in place␟平滑滚动，播放头保持不动␞Where the playhead stays (from the left)␟播放头停留位置（距左侧）␞Longest phoneme (not a pause)␟最长音素（不含停顿）␞Longest pause or gap␟最长停顿或间隙␞Longest singing without a pause (DiffSinger: about 15 s)␟最长无停顿演唱（DiffSinger：约 15 s）␞A pause counts from␟停顿的起算长度␞0 = not checked.␟0 = 不检查。␞For DiffSinger: phonemes shorter than one frame, spaces inside a phoneme, two same pauses in a row, zero length␟用于 DiffSinger：短于一帧的音素、音素内部的空格、连续两个相同停顿、长度为零␞Own checks (scripts)␟自定义检查（脚本）␞Small JavaScript files that mark problems in the labels. For every folder: {0}; for one folder: {1} inside it. The example shows how.␟用于标记标注问题的小型 JavaScript 文件。适用于所有文件夹：{0}；适用于单个文件夹：其中的 {1}。示例展示了写法。␞Run them␟运行␞No scripts yet␟尚无脚本␞Create an example␟创建示例␞Read again␟重新读取␞Take the set from a dictionary:␟从词典获取音素集：␞Any (not checked)␟任意（不检查）␞Example saved: {0}␟示例已保存：{0}␞Search settings␟搜索设置␞Interface size button (in percent) on the toolbar␟工具栏上的界面大小按钮（百分比）␞Detail␟精细度␞Sharper pictures take longer to build and more memory; the values below can be set by hand too.␟画面越清晰，生成时间越长、占用内存越多；以下数值也可手动设置。␞Low␟低␞Normal␟普通␞High␟高␞Highest␟最高␞Snap boundaries to zero crossings of the waveform␟边界吸附到波形过零点␞Keep the scale when going to another file␟切换到其他文件时保持缩放比例␞Phoneme names on the waveform and spectrogram too␟在波形和频谱图上也显示音素名称␞Where inside each phoneme: drag the dot or click the grid␟在每个音素内的位置：拖动圆点或点击网格␞What to show␟显示内容␞Press the keys…␟请按键…␞Reset all␟全部重置␞Click a command and press new keys. Esc cancels, Backspace removes the binding.␟点击命令后按下新按键。Esc 取消，Backspace 删除绑定。␞also used by: {0}␟也用于：{0}␞Mouse␟鼠标␞Click␟点击␞Mouse tools (scissors, hand, play) — keys 1–4 and a toolbar button␟鼠标工具（剪刀、抓手、播放）— 按键 1–4 及工具栏按钮␞Off: the left button always works as the cursor. Right and middle clicks keep their own actions below.␟关闭：左键始终作为光标使用。右键和中键单击保持下方各自的操作。␞Cursor: click selects, drag moves (1)␟光标：点击选择，拖动移动（1）␞Scissors: click adds a boundary (2)␟剪刀：点击添加边界（2）␞Hand: dragging scrolls (3)␟抓手：拖动滚动（3）␞Play: a click plays the phoneme (4)␟播放：点击播放音素（4）␞Scissors cut on label lanes too (otherwise clicks there do what is set below)␟剪刀在标注轨道上也进行切分（否则在那里的点击执行下方设置的操作）␞Mouse wheel␟鼠标滚轮␞Scrolls through time (Ctrl+wheel zooms)␟按时间滚动（Ctrl+滚轮缩放）␞Steps through phonemes, Space plays the chosen one (Shift+wheel scrolls)␟逐个切换音素，Space 播放所选音素（Shift+滚轮滚动）␞Near a boundary both tools drag it. Shift+click and dragging over the audio select a part in both.␟在边界附近时，两种工具都会拖动边界。在两种工具下，Shift+点击及在音频上拖动均可选择一部分。␞Type the name of the new part right away␟立即输入新部分的名称␞Play the part before a new boundary␟播放新边界之前的部分␞Near a boundary a press always drags it; Shift+click and dragging over the audio select a part. Each click below can be set to select, split, play and more.␟在边界附近按下时始终拖动边界；Shift+点击及在音频上拖动可选择一部分。下方每种点击均可设置为选择、切分、播放等操作。␞On label lanes␟在标注层上␞On the waveform and spectrogram␟在波形和频谱图上␞Double click␟双击␞Right click␟右键单击␞Middle click (dragging with it scrolls)␟中键单击（按住拖动可滚动）␞Ctrl+click␟Ctrl+点击␞Alt+click␟Alt+点击␞Touching a boundary (moving or pressing it) selects its phoneme: Space plays it, Delete removes it␟触碰边界（移动或按下）时选中其音素：Space 播放，Delete 删除␞A click on the waveform or spectrogram clears the selection (Space plays from there)␟点击波形或频谱图时清除选区（Space 从该处播放）␞Space while playing starts again (instead of stopping)␟播放时按 Space 重新开始（而非停止）␞A boundary belongs to the phoneme…␟边界属于以下音素…␞Delete on a selected boundary removes that phoneme, Space plays it, and a new boundary creates it (that part gets the new name).␟对选中的边界按 Delete 会删除该音素，按 Space 播放该音素，新建边界时会生成该音素（该部分获得新名称）。␞that ends at it␟在此边界结束的音素␞that starts at it␟从此边界开始的音素␞Nothing␟无操作␞Select␟选择␞Play the phoneme␟播放音素␞Play from here␟从此处播放␞Add a boundary␟添加边界␞Add a boundary and name it␟添加边界并命名␞Remove the phoneme␟删除音素␞Save the changes?␟是否保存更改？␞The labels of {0} have changes that are not saved yet.␟{0} 的标注有尚未保存的更改。␞Don't save␟不保存␞Author␟作者␞Special thanks␟特别鸣谢␞Delete all program data␟删除所有程序数据␞Settings, themes, environments, shortcuts, phoneme dictionaries, plugins, check scripts and caches of mLabeler are deleted, and it starts as on the first launch. Recordings and labels in your folders stay. This can't be undone.␟mLabeler 的设置、主题、环境、快捷键、音素词典、插件、检查脚本和缓存将被删除，程序将像首次启动一样运行。文件夹中的录音和标注将保留。此操作无法撤销。␞Yes, delete everything␟是，全部删除␞Language of the whole program. Changes at once.␟整个程序的语言。立即生效。␞Going to another file saves the labels of this one first. Off: changes stay in memory until you save; leaving the folder asks about them.␟切换到其他文件时，先保存当前文件的标注。关闭：更改保留在内存中直至保存；离开文件夹时会询问。␞Lists compressed formats too. On computers they are read with ffmpeg, which must be installed. Labels and cleaning work only on WAV.␟同时列出压缩格式。在计算机上使用 ffmpeg 读取，需要事先安装。标注和清理仅适用于 WAV。␞Saves the labels automatically every N seconds when something changed. 0 turns it off.␟有更改时每隔 N 秒自动保存标注。0 表示关闭。␞Phones and tablets: the status and navigation bars are hidden.␟手机和平板：隐藏状态栏和导航栏。␞Phones: nothing is drawn under the camera cutout.␟手机：摄像头开孔区域下不绘制任何内容。␞File, Edit, View… menus at the top of the window.␟窗口顶部的“文件”、“编辑”、“视图”等菜单。␞The line at the bottom: phoneme number, done files, scale and more; below it you choose what it shows.␟底部的状态行：音素编号、已完成文件、缩放比例等；可在下方选择显示内容。␞The panel with the list of files and the list of all labels.␟包含文件列表和所有标注列表的面板。␞The panel with details of the selection, checks and comparison.␟包含选区详细信息、检查和比较的面板。␞Names of the toolbar buttons under their icons.␟工具栏按钮图标下方的名称。␞Larger toolbar buttons, easier to tap with a finger or a pen.␟更大的工具栏按钮，便于用手指或触控笔点按。␞Off: the program behind the settings stays as bright as usual, so colours of a theme can be judged while editing it.␟关闭：设置后方的程序保持正常亮度，以便在编辑主题时判断其颜色。␞Text, corners, sliders and switches are drawn with hard pixel edges, like in old programs. Corners keep their rounding as pixel steps.␟文本、圆角、滑块和开关以硬朗的像素边缘绘制，如同旧式程序。圆角以像素阶梯形式保留。␞Square boxes with a tick instead of sliding switches, and classic sliders.␟使用带勾选标记的方形复选框代替滑动开关，并使用经典滑块。␞How round the corners of buttons, fields and windows are; 0 = square.␟按钮、输入框和窗口的圆角程度；0 = 直角。␞Thickness of frames around buttons and fields.␟按钮和输入框边框的粗细。␞A pressed button is filled with one colour instead of a soft highlight.␟按下的按钮以单色填充，而非柔和的高亮。␞Every letter takes the same width, as in a terminal.␟每个字符宽度相同，如同终端。␞Tells the system parts (scroll bars, text cursor) that the theme is dark.␟告知系统组件（滚动条、文本光标）当前为深色主题。␞Size of all elements: text, buttons, panels. Applied when the slider is released.␟所有元素的大小：文字、按钮、面板。松开滑块时应用。␞A button with the interface size in percent on the toolbar, for quick changes.␟工具栏上显示界面大小百分比的按钮，用于快速更改。␞Opening another file keeps the scale you set. Off: each file opens with the scale it had last time (or whole).␟打开其他文件时保持所设置的缩放比例。关闭：每个文件以上次的缩放比例打开（或显示整个文件）。␞The waveform is drawn over the spectrogram and the labels over both, in one picture instead of separate lanes.␟波形绘制在频谱图上，标注绘制在两者之上，合为一个画面，而非分层显示。␞Names of the phonemes are also written over the waveform and the spectrogram, where you choose inside each phoneme.␟音素名称也显示在波形和频谱图上，位于每个音素内所选的位置。␞Size of the label text on the lanes; the lanes grow to fit it.␟层上标注文字的大小；层会随之调整高度。␞How solid the waveform is over the spectrogram in the overlaid view.␟叠加视图中波形覆盖在频谱图上的不透明程度。␞Darkens the spectrogram in the overlaid view so labels and the waveform stay readable.␟在叠加视图中使频谱图变暗，以便标注和波形清晰可读。␞Label lanes above the waveform and spectrogram instead of below.␟标注层位于波形和频谱图上方，而非下方。␞Shows the waveform lane.␟显示波形层。␞Shows the spectrogram lane.␟显示频谱图层。␞Pitch of the voice: a curve over the spectrogram or a piano roll lane with notes.␟人声的音高：频谱图上的曲线，或带音符的钢琴卷帘层。␞On: the pitch curve over the spectrogram. Off: its own lane, a piano roll where notes can be edited.␟开启：音高曲线显示在频谱图上。关闭：单独一层，为可编辑音符的钢琴卷帘。␞A lane with the loudness of the recording.␟显示录音响度的层。␞The first three resonances of the voice (F1 red, F2 orange, F3 green) as dots over the spectrogram. They help to tell similar vowels apart (a / ax, i / e).␟人声的前三个共振峰（F1 红色，F2 橙色，F3 绿色），以点的形式显示在频谱图上。有助于区分相似的元音（a / ax，i / e）。␞Lifts or lowers all colours of the spectrogram.␟提高或降低频谱图的所有颜色。␞Spreads the colours: higher makes quiet and loud parts differ more.␟拉开颜色差异：值越高，安静和响亮部分的差别越大。␞Length of the audio analysed for each column. Longer: sharper harmonics, blurrier in time. Shorter: sharper in time.␟每列所分析音频的长度。越长：谐波越清晰，时间上越模糊。越短：时间上越清晰。␞Time between columns. Smaller is sharper when zoomed in but takes longer and more memory. 0 picks it by the length of the file.␟列之间的时间间隔。越小，放大时越清晰，但耗时更长、占用内存更多。0 表示根据文件长度自动选择。␞How many rows of frequency the picture has. More is finer, slower.␟画面中的频率行数。越多越精细，但速度越慢。␞Anything quieter is drawn as the darkest colour. Lower shows more of the quiet sound and noise.␟低于此值的声音以最暗的颜色绘制。值越低，显示的安静声音和噪声越多。␞Anything louder is drawn as the brightest colour.␟高于此值的声音以最亮的颜色绘制。␞The top of the spectrogram. Singing is mostly below 8 kHz; consonants like s and sh go higher.␟频谱图的顶部。歌声大多低于 8 kHz；s 和 sh 等辅音频率更高。␞How far the arrow keys move a selected boundary (Shift: more).␟方向键移动所选边界的距离（Shift：更大）。␞A boundary can't come closer than this to its neighbours, so no part becomes empty.␟边界与相邻边界的距离不能小于此值，以免出现空的部分。␞Moving a boundary moves every boundary after it by the same amount. Shift switches it while dragging.␟移动一个边界时，其后的所有边界移动相同的距离。拖动时按 Shift 可切换。␞Boundaries at the same time on other lanes (phonemes and words) move together. Alt switches it while dragging.␟其他层（音素和词）上位于同一时间的边界一起移动。拖动时按 Alt 可切换。␞Playing a part repeats it until stopped.␟播放某部分时循环播放，直至停止。␞A boundary placed or dragged by hand moves to the nearest point within 3 ms where the waveform crosses zero, so cut segments don't click.␟手动放置或拖动的边界会移动到 3 ms 范围内最近的波形过零点，使切分的片段不产生爆音。␞Playback volume of the program (the files don't change).␟程序的播放音量（不更改文件）。␞Where the playhead stays when the view scrolls smoothly during playback.␟播放期间视图平滑滚动时播放头的停留位置。␞Slower playback with the same pitch, to hear fast phonemes.␟以较慢速度播放且音高不变，便于听清快速的音素。␞A short part around the boundary plays while it is dragged.␟拖动边界时播放边界附近的一小段。␞oto: dragging the preutterance moves all markers of the entry together. Shift switches it.␟oto：拖动先行发声时，条目的所有标记一起移动。按 Shift 可切换。␞""",
    """Space during playback starts the part again instead of stopping.␟播放期间按 Space 重新播放该部分，而非停止。␞Which phoneme Delete removes and Space plays when a boundary is selected, and which part gets the name of a new boundary.␟选中边界时 Delete 删除哪个音素、Space 播放哪个音素，以及新边界的名称赋予哪个部分。␞What the wheel does over the picture: scroll in time, or step through phonemes.␟滚轮在画面上的作用：按时间滚动，或逐个切换音素。␞After a boundary is added with the mouse, the part before it plays.␟用鼠标添加边界后，播放其前面的部分。␞Pressing or moving a boundary selects its phoneme, so Space plays it right away.␟按下或移动边界时选中其音素，以便立即按 Space 播放。␞A click on the audio clears the selected phoneme; Space then plays from the click.␟点击音频时清除所选音素；之后 Space 从点击处播放。␞What each click does on the label lanes: select, play, rename, split…␟在标注层上各种点击的作用：选择、播放、重命名、切分…␞What each click does on the waveform and spectrogram.␟在波形和频谱图上各种点击的作用。␞Phonemes shorter than this are marked (pauses are not).␟短于此值的音素将被标记（停顿除外）。␞Phonemes outside this set are marked as unknown. Empty: any name is allowed. The buttons below fill it from a dictionary.␟不在此集合中的音素将被标记为未知。留空：允许任何名称。下方按钮可从词典填充。␞A phoneme (not a pause) longer than this is marked. 0 = not checked.␟长于此值的音素（不含停顿）将被标记。0 = 不检查。␞A pause or an unnamed part longer than this is marked. 0 = not checked.␟长于此值的停顿或未命名部分将被标记。0 = 不检查。␞Singing without a long enough pause for longer than this is marked: DiffSinger is trained on segments up to about 15 s.␟无足够长停顿的连续演唱超过此时长时将被标记：DiffSinger 的训练片段最长约 15 s。␞How long a pause must be to count as a place where a segment can end.␟停顿需要多长才可作为片段的结束点。␞Issues that make DiffSinger fail: phonemes shorter than one frame, spaces inside a name, two same pauses in a row, zero length, notes not as long as the phonemes of their sentence.␟导致 DiffSinger 出错的问题：短于一帧的音素、名称内的空格、连续两个相同停顿、长度为零、音符长度与其所在句子的音素长度不一致。␞Runs your own checks written as small JavaScript files after every change.␟每次更改后运行以小型 JavaScript 文件编写的自定义检查。␞The toolkit starts automatically when a tool needs it and stops once no program uses it any more.␟工具需要时工具包自动启动，没有任何程序再使用它时停止。␞Phones and tablets in the same network can use the toolkit of this computer. A token protects it.␟同一网络中的手机和平板可以使用此计算机上的工具包。由令牌提供保护。␞Export a DiffSinger dataset␟导出 DiffSinger 数据集␞Recordings are cut into segments at pauses and saved as wavs/ + transcriptions.csv with phonemes, their grouping into notes (ph_num) and notes. To choose the segments yourself, add a tier named "segments" and name the parts to keep.␟录音在停顿处被切分为片段，并保存为 wavs/ + transcriptions.csv，包含音素、音素到音符的分组（ph_num）及音符。如需自行选择片段，请添加名为“segments”的层，并为要保留的部分命名。␞Folder␟文件夹␞Choose…␟选择…␞All with labels␟所有有标注的文件␞Only done␟仅已完成␞Segments␟片段␞Longest segment␟最长片段␞Shortest segment␟最短片段␞Silence at the edges␟边缘静音␞Grouping into notes (ph_num)␟音符分组（ph_num）␞From the words tier when it fits␟适用时使用词层␞Always by the dictionary␟始终按词典␞Phoneme dictionary␟音素词典␞Vowels start a note, consonants go with the note before them.␟元音开始一个音符，辅音归入其前一个音符。␞From the labels (else by pitch)␟从标注获取（否则按音高）␞By pitch, one per group␟按音高，每组一个␞Sample rate␟采样率␞As recorded␟与录音相同␞Export␟导出␞Exporting {0} of {1}…␟正在导出 {0}/{1}…␞Exported {0} segments ({1}) from {2} recordings into {3}␟已从 {2} 个录音导出 {0} 个片段（{1}）到 {3}␞Skipped without labels: {0}␟已跳过无标注的文件：{0}␞Export failed: {0}␟导出失败：{0}␞Guess from letters␟根据字母推测␞Files and entries␟文件和条目␞Entries␟条目␞Move to the other side␟移到另一侧␞Hide␟隐藏␞Entries as a panel of their own␟条目使用单独的面板␞Back into the files panel␟放回文件面板␞Details…␟详细信息…␞Error details␟错误详细信息␞Copy␟复制␞Copied␟已复制␞Open the log folder␟打开日志文件夹␞Update the toolkit now␟立即更新工具包␞The toolkit gave no reason. Newer versions of it report the exit code and the engine's last output, and keep the engine's whole output in a log: update it and run this again.␟工具包未给出原因。较新版本会报告退出代码和引擎的最后输出，并将引擎的完整输出保存在日志中：请更新后再次运行。␞All files␟所有文件␞Counts␟计数␞text, or name: file: tier:␟文本，或 name: file: tier:␞All shown␟全部显示␞Remove (join with the previous one)␟移除（与前一个合并）␞{0} entries␟{0} 个条目␞Follow␟跟随␞The list scrolls to the phoneme selected on the timeline␟列表滚动到时间轴上所选的音素␞Pick a topic or search, then open a question. Keys can be changed in Settings → Shortcuts.␟选择主题或进行搜索，然后打开问题。按键可在“设置 → 快捷键”中更改。␞Search help␟搜索帮助␞Nothing found. Try another word.␟未找到结果。请尝试其他词语。␞What is this program for?␟此程序有什么用途？␞It places and names the parts of a recording: phonemes, words, notes. Such labels are needed to train singing and speech voices (DiffSinger, UTAU and others).␟它用于定位并命名录音的各个部分：音素、词、音符。训练歌声和语音音源（DiffSinger、UTAU 等）需要此类标注。␞A label file sits next to each recording (.lab, .TextGrid and other formats). The program reads them, lets them be fixed and saves them back.␟每个录音旁都有一个标注文件（.lab、.TextGrid 及其他格式）。程序读取这些文件，供修正后再保存回去。␞How do I open my recordings?␟如何打开录音？␞Open a folder with .wav files ({open}). Sub-folders are included. Files can also be dropped onto the window.␟打开包含 .wav 文件的文件夹（{open}）。包括子文件夹。也可以将文件拖放到窗口上。␞On the first opening the program asks what is labelled in the folder and where the label files are. This can be changed later ({workspace}).␟首次打开时，程序会询问文件夹中标注的内容以及标注文件的位置。之后可以更改（{workspace}）。␞Dropping files onto the file list copies them into the folder; dropping onto the main area only opens them.␟将文件拖放到文件列表会将其复制到文件夹中；拖放到主区域则仅打开它们。␞What is on the screen?␟屏幕上有什么？␞Left: the list of files and the Entries tab with all labels. Middle: the waveform, the spectrogram and the label lanes. Right: details of the selected part, checks and comparison.␟左侧：文件列表和包含所有标注的“条目”选项卡。中间：波形、频谱图和标注层。右侧：所选部分的详细信息、检查和比较。␞Panels open and close with {files} and {inspector}. The buttons on top are grouped; which groups are shown is set in Settings → Interface.␟使用 {files} 和 {inspector} 打开和关闭面板。顶部按钮按组排列；显示哪些组在“设置 → 界面”中设置。␞How do I move around?␟如何浏览？␞Wheel scrolls through time, Ctrl+wheel zooms. {zoom-fit} shows the whole file, {zoom-selection} zooms to the selection.␟滚轮按时间滚动，Ctrl+滚轮缩放。{zoom-fit} 显示整个文件，{zoom-selection} 缩放至选区。␞{next-file} and {prev-file} open the next and previous file. ← → jump between boundaries, Tab between parts, ↑ ↓ between lanes.␟{next-file} 和 {prev-file} 打开下一个和上一个文件。← → 在边界之间跳转，Tab 在部分之间跳转，↑ ↓ 在层之间跳转。␞How does touch input work?␟如何使用触控操作？␞One finger scrolls, two fingers zoom. Tap a part to select it, tap near a boundary to grab it.␟单指滚动，双指缩放。点按某部分可将其选中，点按边界附近可抓取边界。␞The folder button opens the file list. The buttons at the bottom play, step, nudge, split and merge.␟文件夹按钮打开文件列表。底部按钮用于播放、步进、微调、拆分和合并。␞If the buttons are too small or too big, use the interface size button or Settings → View.␟如果按钮过小或过大，请使用界面大小按钮或“设置 → 视图”。␞How do I save? Can I undo?␟如何保存？可以撤销吗？␞{save} saves. Labels are also saved when another file is opened (this can be turned off in Settings → General).␟{save} 保存。打开其他文件时也会保存标注（可在“设置 → 常规”中关闭）。␞{undo} undoes, {redo} redoes. Every action can be undone.␟{undo} 撤销，{redo} 重做。所有操作均可撤销。␞How do I find a command?␟如何查找命令？␞{commands} opens the list of all commands with search. Type a part of the name and press Enter.␟{commands} 打开带搜索功能的全部命令列表。输入名称的一部分并按 Enter。␞Every command from this help can be found there, with its key.␟本帮助中的每个命令均可在其中找到，并附有其按键。␞What are boundaries and parts?␟什么是边界和部分？␞Each lane is cut by boundaries into parts. Each part has a name: a phoneme, a word or a pause (often SP, AP or empty).␟每一层被边界切分为若干部分。每个部分都有名称：音素、词或停顿（通常为 SP、AP 或空）。␞A click on a part selects it and opens its name for editing; a click near a boundary selects the boundary. {deselect} clears the selection. On the waveform a click plays from that place, a right click plays the phoneme.␟点击某部分将其选中并打开名称编辑，点击边界附近则选中边界。{deselect} 清除选区。在波形上，单击从该位置播放，右键单击播放该音素。␞How do I move a boundary?␟如何移动边界？␞Drag it. With Shift everything after it moves too; with Alt the same boundary on other lanes stays in place.␟拖动边界。按住 Shift 时其后的所有内容一起移动；按住 Alt 时其他层上的相同边界保持不动。␞{nudge-left} and {nudge-right} nudge the selected boundary a little, with Shift ten times more.␟{nudge-left} 和 {nudge-right} 小幅微调所选边界，按住 Shift 时幅度为十倍。␞{set-left} and {set-right} put the left or right boundary of the selected part at the cursor.␟{set-left} 和 {set-right} 将所选部分的左边界或右边界设置到光标处。␞How do I add, remove and rename?␟如何添加、删除和重命名？␞{split} splits the part at the cursor and asks for the new name. {merge} merges the part with the next one. {delete} removes the selected boundary.␟{split} 在光标处拆分该部分并询问新名称。{merge} 将该部分与下一部分合并。{delete} 删除所选边界。␞A click, a double click or {rename} renames. After renaming, Space plays the part right away.␟单击、双击或 {rename} 进行重命名。重命名后，Space 立即播放该部分。␞A group of files can be renamed by a pattern ({batch-rename}).␟可以按模式批量重命名一组文件（{batch-rename}）。␞How do I work with a selected range?␟如何处理所选范围？␞Drag over the waveform to select a range. Space plays it, {loop} repeats it.␟在波形上拖动以选择范围。Space 播放该范围，{loop} 循环播放。␞With nothing else selected, {delete} removes all boundaries inside the range, and {nudge-left} / {nudge-right} move them together.␟未选择其他内容时，{delete} 删除范围内的所有边界，{nudge-left} / {nudge-right} 将它们一起移动。␞The boundaries inside the range can also be dragged together with the mouse: press inside the range and drag.␟也可以用鼠标一起拖动范围内的边界：在范围内按下并拖动。␞Can I type the phonemes first?␟可以先输入音素吗？␞Yes. In the details panel, type the phonemes into “Phonemes in advance”, separated by spaces. Each new boundary then names its part with the next phoneme.␟可以。在详细信息面板的“预先输入音素”中输入音素，以空格分隔。之后每个新边界都会用下一个音素为其部分命名。␞“Spread over the selection” places all of them evenly over the selected range at once; then only the boundaries need moving.␟“分布到选区”会一次性将所有音素均匀放置在所选范围内；之后只需移动边界。␞What are the mouse tools?␟什么是鼠标工具？␞They change what the left button does: cursor (select and drag), scissors (a click adds a boundary), hand (drag scrolls), play (a click plays a part). Keys {tool-cursor}–{tool-play}.␟它们改变左键的作用：光标（选择和拖动）、剪刀（点击添加边界）、抓手（拖动滚动）、播放（点击播放某部分）。按键 {tool-cursor}–{tool-play}。␞They are optional: Settings → Mouse. When they are off, the left button is always the cursor. Right and middle buttons, double click and clicks with Ctrl or Alt have their own actions there.␟它们是可选的：“设置 → 鼠标”。关闭时，左键始终作为光标。右键、中键、双击以及按住 Ctrl 或 Alt 的点击在其中各有对应的操作。␞What do the colours and marks mean?␟颜色和标记表示什么？␞A part coloured as a warning has a problem found by the checks (see the Checks topic). Small triangles at the top and bottom of a lane show a part too short to see at this zoom.␟以警告颜色显示的部分存在检查发现的问题（请参阅“检查”主题）。层顶部和底部的小三角形表示该部分过短，在当前缩放比例下无法看到。␞{done} marks the file as finished, {star} adds a star. Both are shown in the file list, which can show only unfinished, starred or unlabelled files.␟{done} 将文件标记为已完成，{star} 添加星标。两者都会显示在文件列表中，文件列表可以只显示未完成、已加星标或无标注的文件。␞What do Ripple and Linked mean?␟“连锁移动”和“联动”是什么意思？␞Ripple ({ripple}): moving a boundary moves everything after it. Linked ({linked}): boundaries at the same time on other lanes move together.␟连锁移动（{ripple}）：移动边界时，其后的所有内容一起移动。联动（{linked}）：其他层上位于同一时间的边界一起移动。␞Sound and view␟声音和视图␞How do I listen?␟如何试听？␞Space plays the selected part or range, Shift+Space plays from the cursor. {speed} switches the speed; {loop} repeats.␟Space 播放所选部分或范围，Shift+Space 从光标处播放。{speed} 切换速度；{loop} 循环播放。␞Volume, following the playhead and where it stays on screen: Settings → Editing → Playback.␟音量、跟随播放头及其在屏幕上的停留位置：“设置 → 编辑 → 播放”。␞What can be shown?␟可以显示哪些内容？␞Waveform, spectrogram, pitch ({pitch}) and loudness. They can be laid over each other in one picture ({overlay}).␟波形、频谱图、音高（{pitch}）和响度。它们可以叠加在一个画面中（{overlay}）。␞Phoneme names can be drawn on the picture too; where exactly in each part is set with the dot pad in Settings → View.␟音素名称也可以绘制在画面上；在每个部分中的具体位置通过“设置 → 视图”中的圆点面板设置。␞Label text size: {labels-bigger} and {labels-smaller}. Spectrogram colours and detail: Settings → Spectrogram.␟标注文字大小：{labels-bigger} 和 {labels-smaller}。频谱图颜色和精细度：“设置 → 频谱图”。␞How do I compare with other labels?␟如何与其他标注进行比较？␞In the details panel, “Compare” shows the labels of the same files from another folder; differences are coloured.␟在详细信息面板中，“比较”显示另一个文件夹中相同文件的标注；差异以颜色标示。␞What are phoneme groups (ph_num)?␟什么是音素分组（ph_num）？␞""",
    """DiffSinger needs to know which phonemes belong to one note. “Group phonemes by notes” builds the groups using the phoneme dictionary of the language.␟DiffSinger 需要知道哪些音素属于同一个音符。“将音素分组为音符”使用该语言的音素词典构建分组。␞How do I get notes?␟如何获得音符？␞“Notes by groups and pitch” makes one note per group with the pitch taken from the recording. “Note pitch from the recording” only updates the pitch.␟“根据分组和音高生成音符”为每组生成一个音符，音高取自录音。“从录音获取音符音高”仅更新音高。␞{note-up} and {note-down} move the selected note by a semitone. Notes can be saved to MIDI and loaded from a MIDI file next to the recording.␟{note-up} 和 {note-down} 将所选音符移动一个半音。音符可以保存为 MIDI，也可以从录音旁的 MIDI 文件加载。␞How do I edit notes and pitch on the piano roll?␟如何在钢琴卷帘上编辑音符和音高？␞Show the pitch in its own lane (View). It becomes a piano roll: keys on the left, one row per semitone, notes as bars. A click on the keys fits it to the singing; Alt+wheel moves it, Ctrl+Alt+wheel zooms.␟将音高显示在单独的层中（视图）。它会变为钢琴卷帘：左侧为琴键，每个半音一行，音符显示为条形。点击琴键可使其适配演唱音域；Alt+滚轮移动，Ctrl+Alt+滚轮缩放。␞Drag a note up or down to change its pitch (with Alt in cents, with Shift only the notes of the song's key), or drag its ends.␟上下拖动音符可更改其音高（按住 Alt 时以音分为单位，按住 Shift 时仅限歌曲调内的音），或拖动其两端。␞Ctrl+click inside a note cuts it there (the second part becomes a slur). Right click on the border of two notes joins them; inside a note it puts back the pitch that was sung.␟在音符内 Ctrl+点击会在该处将其切开（第二部分变为连音）。在两个音符的交界处右键单击会将其合并；在音符内右键单击会恢复所唱的音高。␞The pencil ({f0-pencil}) draws the pitch where the analysis is wrong; the right button erases the drawing; with Shift the line keeps to the notes of the key. The drawn pitch is kept for the file and used for notes from pitch.␟铅笔（{f0-pencil}）用于在分析有误的位置绘制音高；右键擦除绘制内容；按住 Shift 时线条贴合调内的音。绘制的音高会为该文件保留，并用于根据音高生成音符。␞{resynth-world} and {resynth-nsf} play the selection sung with the pitch as it is now, through the toolkit: quickly (WORLD) or with the vocoder DiffSinger models use (NSF-HiFiGAN by OpenVPI, non-commercial licence, downloaded on first use). In a .ds the drawn pitch is written into its f0.␟{resynth-world} 和 {resynth-nsf} 通过工具包以当前音高播放所选部分的演唱：快速（WORLD），或使用 DiffSinger 模型所用的声码器（OpenVPI 的 NSF-HiFiGAN，非商业许可，首次使用时下载）。在 .ds 中，绘制的音高会写入其 f0。␞What do the checks find?␟检查能发现什么？␞Empty names, parts that are too short or too long, unknown phonemes, long pauses and long singing without a pause (DiffSinger works best with segments up to about 15 s). Limits are set in Settings → Checks; 0 turns a check off.␟空名称、过短或过长的部分、未知音素、长停顿以及无停顿的长时间演唱（DiffSinger 处理约 15 s 以内的片段效果最佳）。限值在“设置 → 检查”中设置；0 表示关闭该项检查。␞Found problems are listed in the details panel and counted in the status bar; a click on one goes to it.␟发现的问题列在详细信息面板中，并在状态栏中计数；点击某个问题可转到该处。␞For DiffSinger it also finds phonemes shorter than one frame, spaces inside a phoneme, two same pauses in a row and zero-length parts.␟针对 DiffSinger，还会发现短于一帧的音素、音素内的空格、连续两个相同停顿以及长度为零的部分。␞How do I go through them quickly?␟如何快速逐一查看？␞{review-next} selects the next place to review, worst first: errors, warnings, then the phonemes the aligner was least sure of. {review-prev} goes back.␟{review-next} 选择下一个需要检查的位置，最差的优先：错误、警告，然后是对齐器最不确定的音素。{review-prev} 返回上一个。␞Is there enough to train on?␟数据是否足够训练？␞Tools → “Dataset summary” counts the length, every phoneme and the notes over the whole folder, shows rare phonemes and compares the phonemes with a dictionary. A click on a phoneme finds its files.␟“工具 → 数据集概况”统计整个文件夹的时长、每个音素和音符，显示少见音素，并将音素与词典进行比较。点击某个音素可查找其所在文件。␞Tools → “Check the recordings” looks for clipping, quiet takes, noise, long silence, another sample rate and stereo.␟“工具 → 检查录音”查找削波、音量过低的录音、噪声、长时间静音、不同的采样率和立体声。␞Can I write my own check?␟可以编写自定义检查吗？␞Yes, as a small JavaScript file. Put it into the checks folder of the program (for every folder) or into .mlabeler/checks inside a folder (for that folder only). Settings → Checks shows both folders and can create an example.␟可以，以小型 JavaScript 文件的形式编写。将其放入程序的 checks 文件夹（适用于所有文件夹）或某文件夹内的 .mlabeler/checks（仅适用于该文件夹）。“设置 → 检查”会显示这两个文件夹，并可创建示例。␞What is needed?␟需要什么？␞Autolabel runs in mVocalToolkit, a separate helper program. Settings → Autolabel installs it, starts it and updates it.␟自动标注在 mVocalToolkit 中运行，这是一个单独的辅助程序。“设置 → 自动标注”用于安装、启动和更新它。␞On a phone or tablet the helper runs on a computer in the same network: turn on “Let phones connect” on the computer and enter the shown address on the phone.␟在手机或平板上，辅助程序运行在同一网络中的计算机上：在计算机上启用“允许手机连接”，然后在手机上输入显示的地址。␞How do I run it?␟如何运行？␞Select a range (or nothing for the whole file) and press {autolabel}. Pick a model and a language and start. Progress is shown in the window.␟选择一个范围（不选择则为整个文件）并按 {autolabel}。选择模型和语言后开始。进度显示在窗口中。␞“Place a known text” (SOFA, HubertFA) needs the lyrics or phonemes: type them, load them from a file (lyrics, .lrc, .srt, .lab; the extra is removed) or let Whisper recognise the words first. “Recognise phonemes” (WFL) needs no text.␟“放置已知文本”（SOFA、HubertFA）需要歌词或音素：可直接输入、从文件加载（歌词、.lrc、.srt、.lab；多余内容将被移除），或先让 Whisper 识别歌词。“识别音素”（WFL）无需文本。␞“All files of the folder” labels them one by one and saves each; the text of a file can come from a .txt with the same name.␟“文件夹中的所有文件”会逐个标注文件并分别保存；文件的文本可以来自同名 .txt。␞Known phonemes can be entered: the model then only places them instead of recognising them. “Recognition settings” holds the confidence threshold, decoder and silence options.␟可以输入已知音素：此时模型只负责放置，而不进行识别。“识别设置”包含置信度阈值、解码器和静音选项。␞Where do models come from?␟模型从哪里获取？␞The autolabel window lists ready models; a model is downloaded the first time it is used.␟自动标注窗口列出可用的模型；模型在首次使用时下载。␞Your own model (a checkpoint, a folder or an archive) is added with “Add your own model…” or in Settings → Autolabel.␟自定义模型（检查点、文件夹或压缩包）可通过“添加自定义模型…”或在“设置 → 自动标注”中添加。␞Export and oto␟导出和 oto␞How do I make a DiffSinger dataset?␟如何制作 DiffSinger 数据集？␞“Export a DiffSinger dataset” writes the wav files and transcriptions.csv. Long recordings can be cut into segments at pauses, with a maximum length.␟“导出 DiffSinger 数据集”会写出 wav 文件和 transcriptions.csv。长录音可以在停顿处切分为片段，并可设置最大长度。␞How do I edit oto.ini?␟如何编辑 oto.ini？␞Folders with oto.ini open in the oto mode. Blue: offset and cutoff, green: overlap, red: preutterance, pink: the consonant part.␟包含 oto.ini 的文件夹以 oto 模式打开。蓝色：偏移和截止，绿色：重叠，红色：先行发声，粉色：辅音部分。␞Dragging preutterance moves all markers ({oto-lock} switches this). Q W E R T put offset, overlap, preutterance, consonant and cutoff at the cursor.␟拖动先行发声会移动所有标记（{oto-lock} 可切换）。Q W E R T 将偏移、重叠、先行发声、辅音和截止设置到光标处。␞↑ ↓ go through the entries. {oto-add} adds one, {oto-duplicate} copies, {oto-delete} removes. “Automatic oto” makes entries from the file names and recordings.␟↑ ↓ 逐个浏览条目。{oto-add} 添加条目，{oto-duplicate} 复制，{oto-delete} 删除。“自动 oto”根据文件名和录音生成条目。␞Can I bring a vLabeler project?␟可以导入 vLabeler 项目吗？␞Yes: “Import a vLabeler project” reads an .lbp file.␟可以：“导入 vLabeler 项目”可读取 .lbp 文件。␞Tools␟工具␞How do I record?␟如何录音？␞“Record” opens the recorder: it shows the line to sing, records into the folder and can move to the next line. The list of lines is kept as reclist.txt.␟“录音”打开录音器：显示要演唱的行，录制到文件夹中，并可转到下一行。行列表保存为 reclist.txt。␞R records and stops, Space plays the take, ↑ ↓ change the line. A metronome, count-in and a guide WAV are available.␟R 开始和停止录音，Space 播放录音，↑ ↓ 切换行。提供节拍器、预备拍和引导 WAV。␞How do I edit the sound without touching the labels?␟如何在不改动标注的情况下编辑声音？␞{sound-mode} turns on sound editing: the boundaries are locked, a drag selects any part of the sound, and a panel on the right holds every tool that changes the recording.␟{sound-mode} 开启声音编辑：边界被锁定，拖动可选择声音的任意部分，右侧面板包含所有更改录音的工具。␞In that panel the boundaries can be hidden or drawn dashed, dotted or as lines, and the parts between pauses can be marked.␟在该面板中，可以隐藏边界或将其绘制为虚线、点线或实线，并可标记停顿之间的部分。␞Every change of the recording is undone with {undo}; the first version of the file is kept in .mlabeler/backup.␟对录音的每次更改都可以用 {undo} 撤销；文件的第一个版本保存在 .mlabeler/backup 中。␞How do I clean a recording?␟如何清理录音？␞{cleanup} finds and repairs clicks and lowers noise (the noise is taken from a selected pause). The original can be restored.␟{cleanup} 查找并修复爆音，并降低噪声（噪声样本取自所选停顿）。可以恢复原始录音。␞{segments} marks segments of a long recording on a "segments" lane (by silence, by pauses of the labels or from the selection) and saves each named segment as its own WAV with labels; a "/" in a name makes a subfolder. {trim-silence} cuts silence off both ends; levels and fades are in {cleanup}.␟{segments} 在“segments”层上标记长录音的片段（按静音、按标注中的停顿或根据选区），并将每个已命名的片段连同标注保存为单独的 WAV；名称中的“/”会创建子文件夹。{trim-silence} 去除两端的静音；电平和淡入淡出位于 {cleanup} 中。␞{mute} turns the selection (or the selected phoneme) into silence; {cut-audio} cuts it out of the file and moves the labels after it back. Both are undone with {undo}.␟{mute} 将选区（或所选音素）变为静音；{cut-audio} 将其从文件中剪切掉，并将其后的标注前移。两者均可用 {undo} 撤销。␞{reload-audio} reads the recording again after it was changed in another program.␟{reload-audio} 在录音被其他程序更改后重新读取。␞What are plugins?␟什么是插件？␞Small scripts that change labels: rename, shift, fill and so on ({plugins}). Up to four of them can be assigned to quick keys {plugin-slot-1}–{plugin-slot-4}.␟用于更改标注的小型脚本：重命名、平移、填充等（{plugins}）。最多可将其中四个分配到快捷键 {plugin-slot-1}–{plugin-slot-4}。␞What are environments?␟什么是环境？␞A ready set of panels, lanes, toolbar buttons, bars and the mouse tools switch. Each card lists what it contains.␟面板、层、工具栏按钮、栏以及鼠标工具切换的现成组合。每张卡片都列出了其包含的内容。␞Theme, language, keys and labeling options are not part of an environment and stay as they are. Your own setup can be saved as an environment and shared as a file.␟主题、语言、按键和标注选项不属于环境，会保持不变。自定义设置可以保存为环境，并以文件形式分享。␞How do I change the look?␟如何更改外观？␞Settings → Themes for colours, Settings → View for interface size and font.␟“设置 → 主题”用于颜色，“设置 → 视图”用于界面大小和字体。␞How do I change keys and mouse buttons?␟如何更改按键和鼠标按钮？␞Settings → Shortcuts: click a command and press the new key. Settings → Mouse: actions of the wheel, right and middle buttons, double click and clicks with Ctrl or Alt.␟“设置 → 快捷键”：点击命令并按下新按键。“设置 → 鼠标”：滚轮、右键、中键、双击以及按住 Ctrl 或 Alt 点击时的操作。␞Every settings page has a button that returns its defaults.␟每个设置页面都有恢复默认值的按钮。␞Import a vLabeler project␟导入 vLabeler 项目␞Projects (.lbp) found in this folder and the one above it. Labels and oto.ini are written next to the recordings (old files go to .mlabeler/backup), done/star/tag notes are kept.␟在此文件夹及其上一级文件夹中找到的项目（.lbp）。标注和 oto.ini 写入录音旁（旧文件移至 .mlabeler/backup），已完成/星标/标签信息将保留。␞No .lbp files here. Put the project file into this folder.␟此处没有 .lbp 文件。请将项目文件放入此文件夹。␞Imported: {0} files␟已导入：{0} 个文件␞Import␟导入␞Edit␟编辑␞Go␟转到␞Open folder…␟打开文件夹…␞Show in file manager␟在文件管理器中显示␞Panels␟面板␞Open recent␟打开最近使用的␞Scroll bar under the picture␟画面下方的滚动条␞Large alias over the picture␟画面上方的大号别名␞View during playback␟播放时的视图␞Entries panel on the right␟条目面板位于右侧␞Menu bar␟菜单栏␞Status bar␟状态栏␞Toolbar␟工具栏␞Names under buttons␟按钮下方显示名称␞Big buttons␟大按钮␞Audio␟音频␞Interface␟界面␞Files panel on the right␟文件面板位于右侧␞Details panel on the left␟详细信息面板位于左侧␞Arrange panels and lanes (move, hide, reorder)␟排列面板和层（移动、隐藏、重新排序）␞Spectrogram above the waveform␟频谱图位于波形上方␞Labels over the audio (one picture)␟标注叠加在音频上（单一画面）␞Keyboard shortcuts…␟键盘快捷键…␞Notepad␟记事本␞Any text: lyrics, notes… Kept with the folder.␟任意文本：歌词、备注… 随文件夹保存。␞Into a side panel␟放入侧面板␞Into a window over the picture␟放入画面上方的窗口␞No oto entries yet. Add one with N or the + button.␟尚无 oto 条目。可按 N 或点击 + 按钮添加。␞Alias␟别名␞oto.ini␟oto.ini␞Not in oto␟不在 oto 中␞No such recording in the folder␟文件夹中没有此录音␞Off: dragging the red line moves only it. Shift while dragging does the opposite of this switch.␟关闭：拖动红线时只移动红线。拖动时按住 Shift 可执行与此开关相反的操作。␞Folders (pitches, appends)␟文件夹（音高、追加）␞Click to rename; Enter keeps it, Esc cancels␟点击可重命名；Enter 确认，Esc 取消␞Your own models␟自定义模型␞A model you trained or downloaded, without publishing it anywhere. Pick its checkpoint (.pt, .ckpt): the config, phoneme list and language list next to it are taken too. A folder or an archive works as well. The file has to be on the computer where the toolkit runs.␟自行训练或下载的模型，无需在任何地方发布。选择其检查点（.pt、.ckpt）：旁边的配置、音素列表和语言列表也会一并读取。也可以使用文件夹或压缩包。该文件必须位于运行工具包的计算机上。␞Checkpoint, folder or archive␟检查点、文件夹或压缩包␞File…␟文件…␞""",
    """Folder…␟文件夹…␞What it does␟功能␞Recognises phonemes without text (WFL-ASR)␟无需文本识别音素（WFL-ASR）␞Aligns to text (SOFA)␟按文本对齐（SOFA）␞Aligns to text (HubertFA)␟按文本对齐（HubertFA）␞code, e.g. ru␟代码，例如 ru␞Name in the list␟列表中的名称␞Add the model␟添加模型␞Adding… (the checkpoint is copied)␟正在添加…（正在复制检查点）␞Added: {0}. It is in the Autolabel window under its language.␟已添加：{0}。可在“自动标注”窗口中对应的语言下找到。␞Added before␟此前已添加␞Remove␟移除␞The toolkit has to be running to add models.␟需要运行工具包才能添加模型。␞Folders␟文件夹␞Group the files by subfolder; a click on a folder folds it␟按子文件夹对文件分组；点击文件夹可将其折叠␞Too long␟过长␞Pause too long␟停顿过长␞Too long without a pause␟无停顿时间过长␞Drop to add to the folder {0}␟拖放以添加到文件夹 {0}␞just now␟刚刚␞{0} min ago␟{0} 分钟前␞{0} h ago␟{0} 小时前␞{0} d ago␟{0} 天前␞Labels saved {0}␟标注已于 {0} 保存␞Search by name or phonemes␟按名称或音素搜索␞Phonemes in advance␟预先输入音素␞e.g. SP k a sh i SP␟例如 SP k a sh i SP␞Type the phonemes, then each new boundary names its part with the next one.␟输入音素后，每个新边界都会用下一个音素为其部分命名。␞Next: {0} ({1} left)␟下一个：{0}（剩余 {1} 个）␞Spread over the selection␟分布到选区␞Zero length␟长度为零␞Shorter than one DiffSinger frame␟短于一个 DiffSinger 帧␞Space inside the phoneme␟音素内有空格␞Notes don't last as long as the phonemes of this sentence␟音符长度与此句音素长度不一致␞Two same pauses in a row␟连续两个相同停顿␞Compare␟比较␞Show labels of the same files from another folder (another model, another person) under these, with the differences marked.␟在当前标注下方显示另一个文件夹中相同文件的标注（其他模型、其他人），并标记差异。␞Add folder…␟添加文件夹…␞Use these labels␟使用这些标注␞Show under the labels␟在标注下方显示␞Hide (stays in this list)␟隐藏（保留在此列表中）␞no labels for this file␟此文件没有标注␞{0} ms average, {1} ms median, {2}% under 20 ms, {3} other texts␟平均 {0} ms，中位数 {1} ms，{2}% 小于 20 ms，{3} 处文本不同␞Run␟运行␞Quick slot (Ctrl+number)␟快捷槽位（Ctrl+数字）␞New plugin…␟新建插件…␞Plugin folder␟插件文件夹␞Created {0}: edit main.js and plugin.json, then reopen this list␟已创建 {0}：编辑 main.js 和 plugin.json，然后重新打开此列表␞built in␟内置␞No plugins for this kind of folder.␟没有适用于此类文件夹的插件。␞Cut into segments␟切分为片段␞Segments are the named parts of the "segments" lane. Fill it automatically, then move its boundaries, rename or remove segments as with any labels. Each named segment is saved as its own WAV (and labels) — the recording itself stays as it is.␟片段是“segments”层中已命名的部分。先自动填充该层，然后像处理其他标注一样移动其边界、重命名或删除片段。每个已命名的片段将保存为单独的 WAV（及标注）— 录音本身保持不变。␞Segments by silence␟按静音划分片段␞Segments by pauses of the labels␟按标注中的停顿划分片段␞The selection becomes a segment␟将选区作为片段␞Named segments: {0}␟已命名的片段：{0}␞No "segments" lane yet␟尚无“segments”层␞Save to (folder next to the recording; a "/" in a segment's name makes a subfolder, e.g. power/001)␟保存到（录音旁的文件夹；片段名称中的“/”会创建子文件夹，例如 power/001）␞With labels␟包含标注␞Save the segments␟保存片段␞Saved segments: {0} in {1}␟已保存片段：{0}，位于 {1}␞{0} already exists; nothing was written␟{0} 已存在；未写入任何内容␞Welcome␟欢迎␞A few basic choices first. Everything here can be changed later in Settings.␟请先进行几项基本选择。此处的所有内容之后均可在“设置”中更改。␞Language of the program␟程序语言␞Look␟外观␞Colours of the whole program. Dark is easier on the eyes in the evening.␟整个程序的颜色。深色在晚间更护眼。␞Size of text and buttons␟文字和按钮大小␞Pick what is comfortable to read. On a small screen, a smaller size works better.␟请选择阅读舒适的大小。屏幕较小时，较小的尺寸更合适。␞New versions␟新版本␞At start the program can look on the internet for a newer version and ask whether to download it. Nothing is installed without asking.␟程序可在启动时联网检查新版本，并询问是否下载。未经询问不会安装任何内容。␞Automatic labelling (toolkit)␟自动标注（工具包）␞A separate helper program does the automatic labelling. When it is installed, it can start automatically whenever it is needed and stop once no program uses it.␟自动标注由一个单独的辅助程序完成。安装后，它可在需要时自动启动，并在没有程序使用时自动关闭。␞Next␟下一步␞Lanes␟层␞Bars␟栏␞files␟文件␞details␟详细信息␞none␟无␞waveform␟波形␞spectrogram␟频谱图␞pitch␟音高␞loudness␟响度␞laid over each other␟叠加显示␞big␟大␞compact␟紧凑␞with names␟带名称␞menu␟菜单␞status␟状态␞cursor and tools␟光标和工具␞cursor only␟仅光标␞Not part of an environment: theme, language, shortcuts, mouse buttons and labeling options.␟不属于环境：主题、语言、快捷键、鼠标按钮和标注选项。␞Check the recordings␟检查录音␞Looks for issues that degrade training: clipping, too 