ead of switches␟使用复选框代替开关␞Darken the program behind the settings␟使设置后方的程序变暗␞Delete theme␟删除主题␞Boundaries over the audio␟音频上的边界␞Colour␟颜色␞Thickness␟粗细␞Solid␟实线␞Themes folder…␟主题文件夹…␞Reload from files␟从文件重新加载␞Signals␟信号␞Waveform and labels␟波形和标注␞Tier colours␟层颜色␞Spectrogram colours (quiet → loud)␟频谱图颜色（安静 → 响亮）␞Add a colour␟添加颜色␞{0} (copy)␟{0}（副本）␞Background␟背景␞Panels, second shade␟面板，次要色调␞Borders␟边框␞Secondary text␟次要文本␞Accent␟强调色␞Text on accent␟强调色上的文本␞Errors␟错误␞Good␟正常␞Warnings␟警告␞Audio background␟音频背景␞Zero line␟零线␞Boundaries␟边界␞Selected boundary␟所选边界␞Selected interval␟所选区间␞Interval under the mouse␟鼠标所在区间␞Playhead␟播放头␞Cursor␟光标␞Selected range␟所选范围␞Label text␟标注文字␞Hue␟色相␞Saturation␟饱和度␞Opacity␟不透明度␞No smoothing (hard pixel edges)␟无平滑（硬朗的像素边缘）␞Corners keep their rounding but are drawn as pixel steps; text, sliders and switches without smoothing, as in old programs. On Android text stays smoothed.␟圆角保留其弧度，但以像素阶梯形式绘制；文本、滑块和开关不进行平滑处理，如同旧式程序。在 Android 上文本仍保持平滑。␞Interface font␟界面字体␞As in the theme␟与主题相同␞Find a font␟查找字体␞Sample: a i u e o  ка са на  0:01.250␟示例：a i u e o  ка са на  0:01.250␞Draw the pitch: left button draws, right button erases the drawing␟绘制音高：左键绘制，右键擦除绘制内容␞Undo the last stroke␟撤销上一笔␞Back to the pitch of the recording␟恢复为录音的音高␞Fit to the singing (Alt+wheel moves, Ctrl+Alt+wheel zooms)␟适配演唱音域（Alt+滚轮移动，Ctrl+Alt+滚轮缩放）␞Move the lane up␟上移该层␞Move the lane down␟下移该层␞Speed␟速度␞Sound␟声音␞Overlay␟叠加␞Closer␟放大␞Farther␟缩小␞Whole␟整体␞Auto-oto␟自动 oto␞Add␟添加␞Together␟一起␞Scissors␟剪刀␞Undo and redo␟撤销和重做␞Editing modes␟编辑模式␞Zoom␟缩放␞Automatic␟自动␞Marks␟标记␞Plugins and commands␟插件和命令␞Size␟大小␞Autolabel is running␟自动标注正在运行␞While autolabel runs, the labels can't be changed, so the result is placed exactly where it belongs.␟自动标注运行期间无法更改标注，以确保结果准确地放置在相应位置。␞{0} so far␟目前 {0}␞Model result␟模型结果␞Accept␟接受␞Put it into your labels (can be undone with Ctrl+Z)␟放入标注中（可按 Ctrl+Z 撤销）␞Keep it for later: it stays in Details → Compare, where it can be shown again or removed␟保留以备后用：它将保留在“详细信息 → 比较”中，可再次显示或移除␞Install mVocalToolkit␟安装 mVocalToolkit␞Installs into your user folder with uv: Python and the toolkit itself. Models and engines download later, when you first use them.␟使用 uv 安装到用户文件夹中：包括 Python 和工具包本身。模型和引擎将在首次使用时下载。␞On a phone or tablet the toolkit runs on a computer. On the computer: open mLabeler, Settings → Autolabel, turn on "Let phones connect" — then type the address and token shown there into the fields below.␟在手机或平板上，工具包运行在计算机上。在计算机上：打开 mLabeler，进入“设置 → 自动标注”，启用“允许手机连接”，然后将其中显示的地址和令牌输入下方字段。␞Log…␟日志…␞packages downloaded: {0}␟已下载的包：{0}␞now: {0}␟当前：{0}␞log lines: {0}␟日志行数：{0}␞Updates␟更新␞Which versions to get␟获取哪些版本␞Stable␟稳定版␞Beta␟Beta 版␞Alpha␟Alpha 版␞Stable: tested releases. Beta: new features earlier, mostly finished. Alpha: the newest development builds, may be less stable. Beta and alpha also receive a stable release if it is newer.␟稳定版：经过测试的发布版本。Beta 版：更早提供新功能，基本完成。Alpha 版：最新的开发构建，稳定性可能较低。Beta 版和 Alpha 版在有更新的稳定版时也会获取该稳定版。␞Check for a new version at start␟启动时检查新版本␞Check now␟立即检查␞Checking…␟正在检查…␞Available: {0}␟可用：{0}␞Installed: {0}␟已安装：{0}␞Download␟下载␞What's new␟新增功能␞Not now␟暂不␞Skip this version␟跳过此版本␞A new version of mLabeler␟mLabeler 有新版本␞Version {0} is available (installed: {1}). The download opens in the browser; on a phone, open the downloaded file to install it.␟版本 {0} 已发布（已安装：{1}）。下载将在浏览器中打开；在手机上，请打开下载的文件进行安装。␞Drop to open the recording (or the folder)␟拖放以打开录音（或文件夹）␞Folder settings␟文件夹设置␞What is labelled here␟此处标注的内容␞Used to group phonemes into notes (Edit → Notes) and for the DiffSinger export.␟用于将音素分组为音符（编辑 → 音符）以及 DiffSinger 导出。␞Phonemes and words␟音素和词␞Tiers of intervals: .lab (HTK, NNSVS, DiffSinger), TextGrid, Audacity labels.␟区间层：.lab（HTK、NNSVS、DiffSinger）、TextGrid、Audacity 标注。␞UTAU voicebank (oto.ini)␟UTAU 音源（oto.ini）␞Entries of oto.ini in every folder with recordings.␟每个包含录音的文件夹中的 oto.ini 条目。␞Extra folders with labels (relative, one per line)␟包含标注的额外文件夹（相对路径，每行一个）␞Apply and rescan␟应用并重新扫描␞ (own)␟（自定义）␞Dictionaries folder…␟词典文件夹…␞Make your own from this one…␟基于此词典创建自定义词典…␞No dictionary for your set? “Guess from letters” works with any phonemes, or make your own from the chosen one: a JSON file with lists of vowels and consonants.␟没有合适的词典？“根据字母推测”适用于任何音素集，也可以基于所选词典创建自定义词典：一个包含元音和辅音列表的 JSON 文件。␞Read the files again␟重新读取文件␞Source:␟来源：␞Your own␟自定义␞Last time the program closed because of an error. The report is under “Details”; sending it to the author helps to fix it.␟上次程序因错误而关闭。报告位于“详细信息”中；将其发送给作者有助于修复问题。␞Portable version␟便携版␞Everything is kept in the program folder ({0}): the settings, and the toolkit with its Python, environments and models. They take several gigabytes, so the disk needs room for them. Nothing is written anywhere else.␟所有内容都保存在程序文件夹（{0}）中：设置，以及工具包及其 Python、环境和模型。它们占用数 GB，因此磁盘需要足够的空间。不会向其他任何位置写入文件。␞mVocalToolkit's files were removed, only its launcher is left; install it again␟mVocalToolkit 的文件已被删除，只剩下启动器；请重新安装␞Reinstall␟重新安装␞Click again to reinstall␟再次点击以重新安装␞The toolkit stops and is installed again (a few hundred MB). Downloaded models and engines stay.␟工具包将停止并重新安装（数百 MB）。已下载的模型和引擎会保留。␞A pause at the start and the end of every recording␟每条录音的开头和结尾都要有停顿␞Which one (empty = any pause)␟哪一个（留空 = 任意停顿）␞No pause at the start␟开头没有停顿␞No pause at the end␟结尾没有停顿␞Offset before the overlap, ms␟Offset 在 Overlap 之前，毫秒␞Tip of the day…␟每日提示…␞Tip of the day at start␟启动时显示每日提示␞At every start a tip about a less obvious feature or setting; Help → Tip of the day shows them any time.␟每次启动时显示一条关于不太明显的功能或设置的提示；可随时通过 帮助 → 每日提示 查看。␞Every command in one list␟所有命令集中在一个列表中␞{commands} opens the list of all commands with search. Type a part of the name and press Enter: it is quicker than looking through menus, and every command shows its key next to it, so the list also teaches the shortcuts.␟{commands} 打开带搜索功能的全部命令列表。输入名称的一部分并按 Enter：这比在菜单中查找更快，且每个命令旁都显示其按键，因此该列表也有助于熟悉快捷键。␞Search in the settings␟在设置中搜索␞""",
    """The field at the top of the settings finds any option by its name or by its description. Every page has a button that returns its defaults, so trying an option out costs nothing.␟设置顶部的搜索框可按名称或说明找到任意选项。每个页面都有恢复默认值的按钮，因此可以放心尝试各个选项。␞Type the phonemes first, then cut␟先输入音素，再切分␞In the details panel, type the phonemes of the recording into “Phonemes in advance”, separated by spaces. Each new boundary then names its part with the next phoneme by itself. “Spread over the selection” places all of them evenly over the selected range at once, and only the boundaries are left to move.␟在详细信息面板中，将录音的音素以空格分隔输入“预先输入音素”。之后每个新边界会自动用下一个音素命名其区间。“分布到选区”可一次性将所有音素均匀放置到选中范围内，只需再调整边界即可。␞Ripple and linked boundaries␟连锁移动与联动边界␞With Ripple ({ripple}) moving a boundary moves everything after it; the same happens for one drag when Shift is held. Linked ({linked}) moves the boundaries at the same time on the other lanes too; Alt keeps them in place for one drag. Handy when a word or a whole phrase has to shift without breaking its phonemes.␟启用连锁移动（{ripple}）时，移动边界会同时移动其后的所有内容；按住 Shift 拖动时，该次拖动也具有相同效果。联动（{linked}）会同时移动其他层上同一时刻的边界；按住 Alt 拖动时，该次拖动会保持这些边界不动。适用于需要整体移动单词或整个乐句而不破坏其音素的情况。␞Work with a whole range␟对整个范围进行操作␞Drag over the waveform to select a range. With nothing else selected, {delete} removes every boundary inside it, and {nudge-left} / {nudge-right} move them all together. You can also press inside the range and drag its boundaries with the mouse at once.␟在波形上拖动以选择范围。如果未选中其他内容，{delete} 会删除范围内的所有边界，{nudge-left} / {nudge-right} 会将它们一起移动。也可以在范围内按下并拖动，用鼠标同时移动其中的边界。␞Check the worst places first␟优先检查最可疑的位置␞{review-next} jumps to the next place worth a look, worst first: errors, then warnings, then the phonemes the aligner was least sure of. After autolabel this is the quickest way through a folder: you look only where something is likely wrong.␟{review-next} 跳转到下一个值得查看的位置，按严重程度排序：先是错误，然后是警告，最后是对齐器最不确定的音素。自动标注后，这是检查文件夹的最快方式：只需查看可能有误的地方。␞Checks you can tune␟可调整的检查␞Settings → Checks sets the limits: the shortest part, the longest phoneme, pause and phrase, the set of allowed phonemes (also taken from a dictionary) and DiffSinger checks. “A pause at the start and the end of every recording” makes a missing SP (or another pause you name) an error. 0 turns a limit off.␟设置 → 检查 中可设置各项限制：最短区间、最长音素、停顿和乐句、允许的音素集合（也可从词典获取）以及 DiffSinger 检查。“每条录音的开头和结尾都要有停顿”会将缺少 SP（或指定的其他停顿）视为错误。设为 0 即关闭该限制。␞Your own checks in JavaScript␟使用 JavaScript 编写自定义检查␞A small script can mark any problem the built-in checks don't know about: a phoneme that must not follow another one, a word that must start with a pause and so on. Put it into the checks folder of the program (for every folder) or into .mlabeler/checks inside a folder. Settings → Checks shows both places and creates an example to start from.␟小脚本可以标记内置检查无法识别的任何问题，例如某个音素不能跟在另一个音素之后、某个单词必须以停顿开头等。请将脚本放入程序的 checks 文件夹（适用于所有文件夹）或文件夹内的 .mlabeler/checks 中。设置 → 检查 中会显示这两个位置，并可创建示例作为起点。␞Compare with other labels␟与其他标注进行比较␞“Compare” in the details panel shows the labels of the same files from another folder, with the differences coloured and counted. Good for checking an autolabel model against hand labels, or two people's work against each other.␟详细信息面板中的“比较”会显示另一个文件夹中相同文件的标注，并以颜色标出差异并进行计数。适用于将自动标注模型与手动标注进行对照，或将两人的工作相互对照。␞Everything in one picture␟在同一画面中显示全部内容␞{overlay} lays the waveform, spectrogram and pitch over each other, so the screen holds a taller picture. {names-on-audio} writes the phoneme names on the picture itself; where exactly in each part is set with the dot pad in Settings → View.␟{overlay} 将波形、频谱图和音高叠加显示，使画面可以显示更高的图像。{names-on-audio} 将音素名称直接显示在图像上；在每个区间内的具体显示位置可在 设置 → 视图 中通过圆点面板设置。␞The pitch lane is a piano roll␟音高层即钢琴卷帘␞Show the pitch in its own lane: it gets keys and notes. Drag a note up or down (Alt: in cents, Shift: only notes of the key), Ctrl+click cuts a note, a right click on the border of two notes joins them, inside a note it puts back the sung pitch. Alt+wheel moves the view, Ctrl+Alt+wheel zooms it.␟将音高显示在单独的层中，即可显示琴键和音符。上下拖动音符（Alt：按音分，Shift：仅限调内音），Ctrl+单击切分音符，右键单击两个音符的交界处可将其合并，在音符内部右键单击则恢复演唱时的音高。Alt+滚轮移动视图，Ctrl+Alt+滚轮缩放视图。␞Fix the pitch where the analysis is wrong␟在分析有误处修正音高␞The pencil ({f0-pencil}) draws the pitch by hand; the right button erases the drawing. The drawn pitch is kept for the file, used for notes and written into the f0 of a .ds. {resynth-world} and {resynth-nsf} let you hear the selection sung with it, quickly or with the DiffSinger vocoder.␟铅笔（{f0-pencil}）用于手动绘制音高；右键可擦除绘制的内容。绘制的音高会为该文件保存，用于生成音符，并写入 .ds 的 f0。{resynth-world} 和 {resynth-nsf} 可试听用该音高演唱的选区，前者速度快，后者使用 DiffSinger 声码器。␞Notes for DiffSinger in two commands␟两个命令生成 DiffSinger 音符␞{group-phonemes} decides which phonemes belong to one note using the dictionary of the language; {notes-from-groups} then makes a note per group with the pitch taken from the recording. Notes can be saved as MIDI ({midi-export}) and loaded from a MIDI file next to the recording ({midi-import}).␟{group-phonemes} 根据语言词典确定哪些音素属于同一个音符；随后 {notes-from-groups} 为每组生成一个音符，音高取自录音。音符可保存为 MIDI（{midi-export}），也可从录音旁的 MIDI 文件载入（{midi-import}）。␞{dataset-summary} counts the length, every phoneme and the notes over the whole folder, shows rare phonemes and compares them with a dictionary. A click on a phoneme finds the files that have it, so you know what is missing before training, not after.␟{dataset-summary} 统计整个文件夹的时长、各音素及音符，显示罕见音素并与词典进行比较。单击某个音素可找到包含它的文件，从而在训练前而非训练后发现缺失的内容。␞Check the recordings themselves␟检查录音本身␞{sound-check} looks through the folder for clipping, too quiet takes, noise, long silence, another sample rate and stereo files. These problems are easy to miss by ear and spoil both labelling and training.␟{sound-check} 在文件夹中查找削波、音量过低的录音、噪声、过长的静音、不同的采样率以及立体声文件。这些问题很难凭听觉发现，且会影响标注和训练。␞Edit the sound without breaking the labels␟编辑声音而不破坏标注␞{sound-mode} locks the boundaries, so a drag selects any part of the sound, and the panel on the right holds every tool that changes the recording. {cut-audio} moves the labels after the cut back; every change is undone with {undo}, and the first version of the file stays in .mlabeler/backup.␟{sound-mode} 会锁定边界，因此拖动可选择声音的任意部分，右侧面板集中了所有修改录音的工具。{cut-audio} 会将剪切处之后的标注向前移动；所有修改都可通过 {undo} 撤销，文件的最初版本会保留在 .mlabeler/backup 中。␞Cut a long recording into segments␟将长录音切分为片段␞{segments} marks segments on their own lane: by silence, by the pauses of the labels or from the selection. Each named segment is saved as its own WAV with its labels; a “/” in a name puts it into a subfolder.␟{segments} 在单独的层上标记片段：可按静音、按标注中的停顿或根据选区划分。每个已命名的片段会连同其标注保存为单独的 WAV；名称中的“/”会将其放入子文件夹。␞Clicks and noise␟咔嗒声与噪声␞{cleanup} finds and repairs clicks and lowers the noise. Select a pause first: the noise is learned from it, and the rest of the recording is cleaned by that sample. The original can always be restored.␟{cleanup} 查找并修复咔嗒声，并降低噪声。请先选择一段停顿：程序会从中学习噪声特征，并依据该样本清理录音的其余部分。原始音频随时可以恢复。␞A dataset ready for DiffSinger␟可直接用于 DiffSinger 的数据集␞{export-diffsinger} writes the wav files and transcriptions.csv. Long recordings can be cut at pauses with a maximum length, so the segments stay within what DiffSinger trains well on (about 15 s).␟{export-diffsinger} 写出 wav 文件和 transcriptions.csv。长录音可按停顿切分并设置最大长度，使片段保持在 DiffSinger 能良好训练的范围内（约 15 s）。␞Autolabel a whole folder␟自动标注整个文件夹␞In the autolabel window pick “All files of the folder”: the files are labelled one by one and each is saved. The text of a file can come from a .txt with the same name; lyrics can also be loaded from .lrc, .srt or .lab, or recognised by Whisper first.␟在自动标注窗口中选择“文件夹中的所有文件”：文件将逐个标注并分别保存。文件的文本可取自同名的 .txt；歌词也可从 .lrc、.srt 或 .lab 载入，或先由 Whisper 识别。␞You know the phonemes, let the model place them␟已知音素时，让模型来放置␞Enter the known phonemes in the autolabel window: the model then only places them instead of recognising them, which is much more reliable. “Recognition settings” hold the confidence threshold, the decoder and the silence options.␟在自动标注窗口中输入已知音素：模型将只放置这些音素而不进行识别，结果可靠得多。“识别设置”中包含置信度阈值、解码器和静音选项。␞A model you trained or downloaded is added with “Add your own model…” in the autolabel window or in Settings → Autolabel: a checkpoint, a folder or an archive. Its config and phoneme list are picked up from next to it.␟自己训练或下载的模型可通过自动标注窗口或 设置 → 自动标注 中的“添加自定义模型…”添加：支持检查点、文件夹或压缩包。其配置和音素列表会从同一位置自动读取。␞Autolabel on a phone␟在手机上进行自动标注␞The toolkit runs on a computer, but a phone or tablet in the same network can use it. On the computer turn on “Let phones connect” in Settings → Autolabel, then type the shown address and token on the phone.␟工具包在计算机上运行，但同一网络中的手机或平板电脑也可以使用它。在计算机上的 设置 → 自动标注 中启用“允许手机连接”，然后在手机上输入显示的地址和令牌。␞oto from the file names␟根据文件名生成 oto␞{auto-oto} makes entries from the names of the samples (kana, romaji, Cyrillic, or runs like “babab”) and the recordings: CV, VCV, CVVC and Russian CVC. The tempo is found by itself; enter it only if the result looks shifted. “Keep, add missing aliases” leaves your finished entries alone.␟{auto-oto} 根据采样的名称（假名、罗马字、西里尔字母或类似“babab”的连续音）及录音生成条目：支持 CV、VCV、CVVC 和俄语 CVC。速度会自动检测；仅当结果看起来有偏移时才需输入。“保留，添加缺少的别名”不会改动已完成的条目。␞Quick keys for oto␟oto 快捷键␞In the oto mode Q W E R T put the offset, overlap, preutterance, consonant and cutoff at the cursor, ↑ ↓ go through the entries. Dragging the preutterance moves all the markers together; {oto-lock} switches this off when only the preutterance should move.␟在 oto 模式下，Q W E R T 分别将偏移、重叠、先行发声、固定段和截止设置到光标位置，↑ ↓ 切换条目。拖动先行发声会同时移动所有标记；如只需移动先行发声，可用 {oto-lock} 关闭此行为。␞Record from a reclist␟按录音表录音␞{record} shows the line to sing, records into the folder and moves on. R starts and stops, Space plays the take, ↑ ↓ change the line. A metronome, count-in and a guide WAV help to keep the tempo, which also makes automatic oto more exact.␟{record} 显示要演唱的行，录音到文件夹中并转到下一行。R 开始和停止录音，Space 播放录音，↑ ↓ 切换行。节拍器、预备拍和引导 WAV 有助于保持速度，这也会使自动 oto 更准确。␞Plugins on quick keys␟为插件分配快捷键␞Plugins ({plugins}) are small scripts that change the labels: rename, shift, fill and more. Up to four of them can sit on {plugin-slot-1}–{plugin-slot-4}, so a routine fix becomes one key.␟插件（{plugins}）是修改标注的小脚本：重命名、移动、填充等。最多可将其中四个分配到 {plugin-slot-1}–{plugin-slot-4}，使常用的修改只需一个按键。␞Save your own environment␟保存自定义工作环境␞An environment is a ready set of panels, lanes, toolbar buttons and bars. Arrange the screen the way you like, save it as your own environment in Settings → Interface and share it as a file. Theme, language and keys are not part of it and stay as they are.␟工作环境是一组预设的面板、层、工具栏按钮和栏。按需排列界面，在 设置 → 界面 中将其保存为自定义环境，并以文件形式共享。主题、语言和按键不包含在环境中，保持不变。␞Mouse buttons do what you want␟自定义鼠标按键␞Settings → Mouse sets what the right and middle buttons, the double click, the wheel and clicks with Ctrl or Alt do. The mouse tools (cursor, scissors, hand, play) are optional; when they are off, the left button is always the cursor.␟设置 → 鼠标 中可设置右键、中键、双击、滚轮以及按住 Ctrl 或 Alt 单击的功能。鼠标工具（光标、剪刀、抓手、播放）为可选；关闭时，左键始终作为光标使用。␞Rename across the whole folder␟在整个文件夹中重命名␞{batch-rename} renames labels by a pattern in every file at once, for example one phoneme set into another. Every change can be undone.␟{batch-rename} 按模式一次性重命名所有文件中的标注，例如将一套音素转换为另一套。所有修改均可撤销。␞Keep track of what is done␟跟踪完成进度␞{done} marks a file as finished, {star} adds a star. The file list can show only unfinished, starred or unlabelled files, and the status bar counts the finished ones, so a large folder doesn't get lost.␟{done} 将文件标记为已完成，{star} 为其加星标。文件列表可仅显示未完成、已加星标或未标注的文件，状态栏会统计已完成的文件数，因此在大型文件夹中也不会遗漏。␞Labels are backed up␟标注会自动备份␞Before a label file is overwritten for the first time in a session, its old version is copied to .mlabeler/backup inside the folder. Together with undo this means an edit can always be taken back.␟在一次会话中首次覆盖某个标注文件之前，其旧版本会被复制到文件夹内的 .mlabeler/backup。结合撤销功能，任何编辑都可以恢复。␞Saving without thinking about it␟无需操心的保存␞""",
    """Labels are saved when you go to another file; this can be turned off in Settings → General, then changes wait until you save. The same page has autosave every N seconds, for long sessions in one file.␟切换到其他文件时会保存标注；可在 设置 → 常规 中关闭此功能，此时修改将保留到手动保存为止。同一页面还提供每 N 秒自动保存，适用于在单个文件中长时间工作。␞Many label formats␟支持多种标注格式␞Tip of the day␟每日提示␞Show tips at start␟启动时显示提示␞Previous␟上一条␞Next tip␟下一条提示␞Renamed: {0} → {1}␟已重命名：{0} → {1}␞{0} was moved to {1}␟{0} 已移至 {1}␞Couldn't do it: {0}␟无法完成：{0}␞Dictionary of␟词典来源␞The language's own rules␟语言自身的规则␞The phoneme model has no dictionary of its own: words are split with the dictionary of an aligner model of the same language (its G2P guesses the words it lacks), or with the built-in rules of Japanese, Chinese and Korean. The phonemes must be the ones the phoneme model knows.␟音素识别模型没有自己的词典：单词使用同一语言的对齐模型的词典拆分（词典中缺少的单词由其 G2P 推测），或使用日语、汉语和韩语的内置规则拆分。音素必须是音素识别模型已知的音素。␞Split into phonemes␟拆分为音素␞Not in the dictionary, left as written: {0}␟不在词典中，保持原样：{0}␞No aligner models for this language: only the language's own rules (Japanese, Chinese, Korean).␟该语言没有对齐模型：只能使用语言自身的规则（日语、汉语、韩语）。␞Rename…␟重命名…␞Delete…␟删除…␞Open␟打开␞Rename the recording␟重命名录音␞Will be renamed: {0} files, oto entries: {1}, transcriptions.csv rows: {2}␟将重命名：{0} 个文件，oto 条目 {1} 个，transcriptions.csv 行 {2} 个␞Can't: {0}␟无法执行：{0}␞the name has characters a file name can't have␟名称中包含文件名不允许使用的字符␞already exists␟已存在␞Delete the recording?␟删除录音？␞{0} and every file named after it are moved to .mlabeler/trash inside the folder, where they can be taken back. Its oto.ini entries and transcriptions.csv rows are removed (the previous versions of those files are kept there too).␟{0} 及所有以其命名的文件将移至文件夹内的 .mlabeler/trash，可从中恢复。其 oto.ini 条目和 transcriptions.csv 行将被删除（这些文件的先前版本也会保存在该处）。␞Also: {0}␟另外：{0}␞Go to it␟转到␞Rename every «{0}»…␟重命名所有“{0}”…␞Show only «{0}»␟仅显示“{0}”␞Import and export␟导入和导出␞Recording␟录音␞Marker at the cursor␟光标处的标记␞Labels on the picture␟画面上的标注␞Within the file␟文件内␞Checking the dataset␟检查数据集␞With autotune␟自动修音播放␞Tuning…␟正在修音…␞Plays the take with every note pulled to the nearest semitone at once, the well-known robotic effect. Just for fun: the saved take stays as it was sung.␟将每个音立即拉到最近的半音后播放这一遍录音，也就是常见的“机器人”效果。仅供娱乐：保存的录音保持原样。␞Plays the take over the music with every note pulled at once to the note the song's own singer sings there (after "Make a backing track"; otherwise to the nearest semitone), the well-known robotic effect. Just for fun: the saved take stays as it was sung.␟在音乐上播放这一遍录音，每个音立即拉到原唱在该处所唱的音（需先“制作伴奏”；否则拉到最近的半音），也就是常见的“机器人”效果。仅供娱乐：保存的录音保持原样。␞Half␟一半␞Singer's line␟原唱的音高线␞What the autotune takes from the song's singer: only the notes (the robotic effect), the whole pitch line with vibrato and slides (your voice sung the way they sing), or half of it. The line fits best where you sing in time with the original.␟自动修音从原唱那里取什么：只取音符（“机器人”效果）、包括颤音和滑音的整条音高线（用你的声音按原唱的方式唱），或取一半。与原曲节奏一致的地方，音高线贴合得最好。␞Build for old Windows, without mVocalToolkit␟适用于旧版 Windows 的版本（不含 mVocalToolkit）␞Made for Windows 7 and 8.1 (64-bit). The toolkit can't be installed here; autolabel works through the toolkit of another computer in the network. On Windows 10 and 11 the usual build is better.␟适用于 Windows 7 和 8.1（64 位）。此处无法安装工具包；自动标注通过网络中另一台电脑上的工具包进行。在 Windows 10 和 11 上建议使用普通版本。␞This build for old Windows has no toolkit of its own (it doesn't run there). Autolabel can use the toolkit of another computer in the network: there open mLabeler, Settings → Autolabel, turn on "Let phones connect", then type the address and token shown there into the fields below.␟此旧版 Windows 版本没有自带工具包（它无法在此运行）。自动标注可以使用网络中另一台电脑的工具包：在那台电脑上打开 mLabeler，设置 → 自动标注，开启“允许手机连接”，然后将显示的地址和令牌填入下方栏中。␞Old Windows: without mVocalToolkit␟旧版 Windows：不含 mVocalToolkit␞On Windows 7 and 8.1 the toolkit can't be installed (it doesn't run there); autolabel works through the toolkit of another computer in the network. Everything else works as usual.␟在 Windows 7 和 8.1 上无法安装工具包（它无法在其上运行）；自动标注通过网络中另一台电脑上的工具包进行。其他功能照常可用。␞On Windows older than 10 the toolkit doesn't run. Autolabel can use the toolkit of another computer in the network: there open mLabeler, Settings → Autolabel, turn on "Let phones connect", then type the address and token shown there into the fields below.␟工具包无法在 Windows 10 之前的版本上运行。自动标注可以使用网络中另一台电脑的工具包：在那台电脑上打开 mLabeler，设置 → 自动标注，开启“允许手机连接”，然后将显示的地址和令牌填入下方栏中。␞Cut out phonemes…␟切出音素…␞Cut out phonemes␟切出音素␞Every place where these phonemes (or runs of them) are in the labels of the folder is cut out of its recording, to listen to them one after another and find wrong ones. Separate them with commas; a run with spaces: "h, s, k t, pau a".␟将文件夹标注中出现这些音素（或其连续组合）的每一处从录音中切出，以便逐个连续试听并找出错误。用逗号分隔；组合用空格：“h, s, k t, pau a”。␞How to save␟保存方式␞Each piece in its own file␟每段单独一个文件␞One file per phoneme␟每个音素一个文件␞One file per phoneme and recording␟每个音素和录音一个文件␞Into the folder␟保存到文件夹␞Cut␟切出␞Cut {0} pieces into {1}␟已切出 {0} 段，保存到 {1}␞These phonemes are not in the labels␟标注中没有这些音素␞Cutting… {0} of {1} files␟正在切出… {0}/{1} 个文件␞Boundaries moved: {0}␟已移动边界：{0}␞Refined {0} files, boundaries moved: {1}␟已校正 {0} 个文件，移动边界：{1}␞Refine boundaries…␟校正边界…␞Refines boundaries (mRefinerModel)␟校正边界（mRefinerModel）␞Added: {0}. It is in Tools → Refine boundaries.␟已添加：{0}。位于 工具 → 校正边界。␞Refine boundaries␟校正边界␞A refiner model moves the phoneme boundaries to where they are in the sound; the phonemes and their order stay. It works after any labelling: an aligner's, a recogniser's or your own.␟校正模型把音素边界移到声音中真正的位置；音素及其顺序保持不变。适用于任何标注之后：对齐器、识别或手工标注。␞What to refine␟校正范围␞All labelled files ({0})␟所有已标注的文件（{0}）␞Their labels are changed and saved.␟它们的标注会被修改并保存。␞Refiner model␟校正模型␞How boldly␟校正力度␞Auto␟自动␞As trained␟按训练方式␞Carefully␟谨慎␞As trained: for labels of the model's language and style. Carefully: only confident boundaries and not far, for other languages or another labelling style; it gains less but practically never makes labels worse. Auto: carefully when most phonemes are unknown to the model.␟按训练方式：用于与模型相同语言和风格的标注。谨慎：只移动有把握的边界且移动不远，用于其他语言或其他标注风格；收益较小，但几乎不会让标注变差。自动：当大多数音素对模型来说是未知时使用谨慎模式。␞No refiner models in the toolkit␟工具包中没有校正模型␞Refine␟校正␞Refine the boundaries afterwards (a refiner model)␟之后校正边界（校正模型）␞Karaoke settings␟卡拉 OK 设置␞Music␟音乐␞Separating the voice from the music␟分离人声与音乐␞BS-Roformer with an NVIDIA graphics card, MDX-Net without one␟有 NVIDIA 显卡时使用 BS-Roformer，否则使用 MDX-Net␞Fast (MDX-Net)␟快速（MDX-Net）␞Best (BS-Roformer)␟最佳（BS-Roformer）␞Mel-Roformer␟Mel-Roformer␞Roformer models are slow without a graphics card (minutes per song). A song is separated once; to separate it again with another model, remove its parts in the songs folder.␟没有显卡时 Roformer 模型很慢（每首歌需数分钟）。每首歌只分离一次；如需用其他模型重新分离，请删除歌曲文件夹中该歌曲的分轨。␞Recognising the words␟识别歌词␞Fast (small)␟快速（small）␞Medium␟中等（medium）␞Accurate (large-v3-turbo)␟精确（large-v3-turbo）␞Most accurate (large-v3, slow)␟最精确（large-v3，较慢）␞Each model is downloaded on first use. Without a graphics card the small ones are several times faster.␟每个模型会在首次使用时下载。没有显卡时，小模型要快好几倍。␞Files moved to the trash: {0} ({1})␟已移至回收站的文件：{0}（{1}）␞Joined {0} recordings into {1}␟已将 {0} 个录音合并为 {1}␞{0} already exists␟{0} 已存在␞the name is empty or has characters a file name can't have␟名称为空或包含文件名中不允许的字符␞The change from this phoneme to the next: a unit or not␟从此音素到下一个音素的过渡：是否作为单元␞This phoneme held: a unit or not␟此音素的延长：是否作为单元␞Units of the folder (.trans)…␟文件夹的单元（.trans）…␞Pick (Ctrl+click, Shift+click)␟选择（Ctrl+click、Shift+click）␞Join the picked ({0})…␟合并所选项（{0}）…␞Delete the picked ({0})…␟删除所选项（{0}）…␞Picked: {0}␟已选择：{0}␞Join…␟合并…␞Join recordings␟合并录音␞The recordings are joined in this order into a new one next to the first, with their labels (every lane of any of them, its times moved along). The labels are saved in the first recording's format.␟按此顺序将录音合并为一个新录音，放在第一个录音旁边，并带上它们的标注（任一录音中的所有层，时间相应顺延）。标注以第一个录音的格式保存。␞Name of the new recording␟新录音的名称␞Silence between them␟录音之间的静音␞Move the joined recordings to the trash␟将已合并的录音移至回收站␞Join␟合并␞Down␟下移␞Delete {0} recordings?␟删除 {0} 个录音？␞They and every file named after them are moved to .mlabeler/trash inside the folder, where they can be taken back. Their oto.ini entries and transcriptions.csv rows are removed.␟这些录音以及以其命名的所有文件将移至文件夹内的 .mlabeler/trash，可从那里恢复。它们在 oto.ini 中的条目和 transcriptions.csv 中的行将被删除。␞Units of the transcription (.trans)␟转写的单元（.trans）␞Units of the folder (.trans)␟文件夹的单元（.trans）␞Every change between two phonemes in the .seg/.trans recordings of the folder, with the units the transcriptions keep. A unit kept in several recordings only makes the voicebank bigger: listen to them and keep the best one. Kept units are ticked; a click on a tick changes it.␟文件夹中 .seg/.trans 录音里音素之间的所有过渡，以及转写中保留的单元。在多个录音中保留的单元只会让音源变大：请试听并保留最好的一个。已保留的单元带有勾选标记；点击勾选标记可切换。␞Reading the recordings… {0} of {1}␟正在读取录音… {0}/{1}␞No .seg/.trans recordings in this folder␟此文件夹中没有 .seg/.trans 录音␞Kept more than once ({0})␟保留多次（{0}）␞Kept nowhere ({0})␟未在任何地方保留（{0}）␞kept {0} of {1}␟已保留 {0}/{1}␞Keep one of each (the first)␟每个只保留一个（第一个）␞Where a unit is kept in several recordings, only the first of them (in the order of the list) keeps it. Check the result before saving.␟如果一个单元在多个录音中保留，则只在其中第一个（按列表顺序）中保留。保存前请检查结果。␞Only this one␟仅此一个␞Save ({0} files)␟保存（{0} 个文件）␞Units saved in {0} files␟已将单元保存到 {0} 个文件␞Unit, e.g. b' a␟单元，例如 b' a␞Open the recording␟打开录音␞The program reads and writes .lab, Praat .TextGrid, Audacity labels, DiffSinger .ds and transcriptions.csv and UTAU oto.ini, and imports vLabeler projects (.lbp). A file is saved back in the format it came in.␟本程序可读写 .lab、Praat .TextGrid、Audacity 标签、DiffSinger .ds 和 transcriptions.csv 以及 UTAU oto.ini，并可导入 vLabeler 项目（.lbp）。文件将按原格式保存。␞Every file named after it gets the new name too: labels of any format, MIDI, UTAU caches (.frq…), here and in the label folders. Its oto.ini entries, transcriptions.csv rows, marks and drawn pitch follow.␟所有以该录音命名的文件也会获得新名称：任意格式的标注、MIDI、UTAU 缓存（.frq…），包括同一位置和标注文件夹中的文件。其 oto.ini 条目、transcriptions.csv 行、标记和绘制的音高也会随之更新。␞Transition from this phoneme to the next: keep or take away␟从此音素到下一个音素的过渡：保留或去掉␞This phoneme held: keep or take away␟此音素持续：保留或去掉␞Transitions of the folder (.trans)…␟文件夹的过渡 (.trans)…␞Transitions (.trans)␟过渡 (.trans)␞Transitions of the folder (.trans)␟文件夹的过渡 (.trans)␞Every transition between two phonemes in the .seg/.trans recordings of the folder, and where the transcriptions keep it. A transition kept in several recordings only makes the voicebank bigger: listen to them and keep the best one. Kept ones are switched on; a click changes it.␟文件夹中 .seg/.trans 录音里两个音素之间的所有过渡，以及转写中保留它们的位置。在多个录音中保留的过渡只会让音源库变大：试听后保留最好的一个。保留的为开启状态，点击切换。␞Where a transition is kept in several recordings, only the first of them (in the order of the list) keeps it. Check the result before saving.␟某个过渡在多个录音中保留时，只在其中第一个（按列表顺序）保留。保存前请检查结果。␞Only here␟仅此处␞Transitions saved in {0} files␟已保存过渡的文件：{0}␞Transition, e.g. b' a␟过渡，例如 b' a␞Repeats count only inside one folder (one pitch)␟仅在同一文件夹（同一音高）内计算重复␞With a sub-folder per pitch, the same transition in another folder is not a repeat: each pitch keeps its own.␟每个音高一个子文件夹时，其他文件夹中的相同过渡不算重复：每个音高各保留一个。␞Order:␟排序：␞By name␟按名称␞Kept most often␟保留次数多的在前␞Found most often␟出现次数多的在前␞"""
